    "tiktok": "\"Mama, is someone watching everything I do?\" A gentle bedtime lesson on the two angels who write our deeds. Qur'an 82:10-12.",
    "shorts": "The two angels who write everything we do - explained gently for little ones. Qur'an 82:10-12.",
